Sent: Friday, January 3, 2025 2:28 PM
To: BLISS Logan * OPRD <logan.bliss@oprd.oregon.gov>
Subject: Store/Visitor Center Host position at Honeyman

You don't often get email from rsw@rswfire.com<mailto:rsw@rswfire.com>. Lea=
rn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>
Hi Logan,

I recently started as a volunteer host (host 40423) at Tugman State Park th=
is month and heard about the Store/Visitor Center Host position at Honeyman=
. I understand Honeyman is an ATV park, and as a Jeep Wrangler owner, I'm p=
articularly interested in becoming part of that community.

Would you be open to discussing the volunteer opportunity? I'd love to lear=
n more about what you're looking for in a host.

Thanks,
Sam
828-333-8877

